@page
@model Portfolio.Pages.Projects.FamilyKeyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Family Key";
}

<header class="page-header">
    <p class="page-kicker"><i class="bi bi-kanban" aria-hidden="true"></i> Project archive</p>
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">The design and history of a genealogical publishing service developed through Kumusoft, LLC.</p>
</header>
<nav class="section-nav" aria-label="Related project pages"><a asp-page="/Projects/Index">All projects</a><a asp-page="/Git">Public repositories</a></nav>
<section id="section-1" class="reading-layout">
<article class="reading-main prose">
<h2>Genealogy and Family History Presentation</h2>
        <p>
            The Family Key project began around 2001, and I became involved around 2002 through the Kumusoft, LLC partnership. It was designed to be a hosted genealogical site for people’s family history.
            The idea was to provide rich media and family stories of ancestors and enabling services, such as Google, to be able to index the content
            for these family members seeking to publish their family’s history. Sadly there was a failure in the partnership and the company
            dissolved in 2005, ending the project before it launched.
        </p>

        <p>
            Family Key is no longer an active product or being hosted on any public servers at this time.
        </p>
</article>
<aside class="reading-aside content-panel" aria-label="Technology details">
<h3>Technology</h3>
<p>Some of the Technologies utilized in its development:</p>
<ul class="tag-list">
                <li>C#.NET, Webforms, ASP.NET</li>
                <li>IIS</li>
                <li>SQL</li>
            </ul>
</aside>
</section>
